# The headless display server's accepted differences from the X11
# reference: it draws with gcon's own rasterizer (graphics/raster), by
# X's rules but with arcs flattened to polygons, where X rasterizes them
# exactly (a few pixels at the edges of circles and pies, with room over
# 2, 3 and 13 when recorded); its text is X's misc-fixed fonts alone,
# where the reference has Lucida, Courier, Helvetica and Times. Format as
# tests/ref/tolerance.
#
# name      pixels  output
clipcopy    6       same     # arc edges
lines       6       same     # arc edges
shapes      20      same     # the edges of a filled circle and a pie
text        -1      differs  # misc-fixed for every family
